eries processors, the DL560 Gen9 can be configured with multiple CPUs to deliver substantial compute performance for virtualization, database workloads, enterprise applications, analytics, and other demanding tasks.</p><p><br></p><p>The server supports high-capacity DDR4 SmartMemory and provides flexible storage and expansion options. Its 4U rack-mount design provides additional internal space for enterprise-grade components while maintaining compatibility with standard data center racks.</p><p><br></p><p>With HPE iLO management, HPE Smart Array storage technologies, flexible networking, and scalable processor and memory configurations, the DL560 Gen9 is suitable for demanding enterprise and data center deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>HPE ProLiant DL560 Gen9 4U Rack Server</li><li>Four-socket enterprise server platform</li><li>Intel Xeon E5-4600 v3/v4 processor support</li><li>DDR4 HPE SmartMemory support</li><li>High memory capacity for demanding workloads</li><li>Flexible SFF storage configurations</li><li>HPE Smart Array RAID controller options</li><li>HPE iLO 4 remote server management</li><li>PCIe expansion capabilities</li><li>Flexible Ethernet networking options</li><li>Redundant power supply support</li><li>Enterprise-grade reliability and scalability</li><li>Designed for virtualization and data-intensive applications</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server","href":"/hpe-proliant-dl380-gen10-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL180 Gen9 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl180-gen9-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380 Gen9","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380-gen9","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380P Gen8 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380p-gen8-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name